{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "49943e2f-5247-8799-b407-f5cd61fcf421",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T10:40:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Pellegrino",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:38:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. Buenos días, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Um, I think I got the wrong number. I was trying to get a restaurant, a place that does a good cabinet. That's a milkshake, by the way, coffee cabinet, if you're not from around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know what a cabinet is. No, this is the City Clerk at City Hall. No milkshakes here, unfortunately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, no, I figured that out when you said City Clerk. I'm working off an old list. Wrote the numbers on the back of an envelope years ago. Apparently some of them are now city offices."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a new one. Do you remember the name of the restaurant? I can't look up every place in town, but I can tell you where you'd find a listing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:39:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the one on the waterfront side, I just can't think of the name right now. It'll come to me. I'll look it up online instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:39:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's probably quickest. A search on your phone with the neighborhood and the word restaurant should bring it up. Or the phone book, if you still have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, the envelope is basically my phone book. Anyway, funny thing, an old friend called me out of the blue today. Haven't talked in, oh, a long time. That's why I wanted to take him out for lunch. So I started dialing from the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:39:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's nice. Well, I hope you find the place and have a good lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:39:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Sorry to bother you. You've got real work to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:39:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all. If you ever need anything from the city, licenses, records, that kind of thing, you've got the right number now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:40:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know. I'll keep it on the envelope. Thanks again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:40:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T10:40:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
